      "writtenOn": "2017-04-03T21:45:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not necessary.Removed (the other) StringNetworkSpecifier.aidl. \n\nThe file is necessary if the class is passed as part of an AIDL interface (it needs to be parcelable and have such a file). However, we\u0027re not specifying any of these classes as part of an AIDL interface.\n\nThe classes exposed as part of AIDL are NetworkRequest and NetworkCapabilities and they have a corresponding .aidl files.",
      "parentUuid": "1bfb2db2_f1ac65ad",
