      "writtenOn": "2017-04-03T08:54:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what adding this method will do to apps that call \"setNetworkSpecifier(null)\".\n\nIt\u0027s clear to me that an app that targets O can\u0027t do that: it must write setNetworkSpecifier((String) null) or setNetworkSpecifier((NetworkSpecifier) null), or get an error at compile time.\n\nBut I\u0027m not sure what will happen at runtime to an app that targeted a previous SDK version. Perhaps the binary already contains the fully-qualified name and everything is fine. I\u0027ve asked the API council to clarify that.",
