      "writtenOn": "2017-04-03T08:54:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not a fan of having to enumerate all possible classes here.\n\nIf the user passes in a non-framework Parcelable class we\u0027ll already throw an exception because the framework won\u0027t know how to unparcel it. Is that enough?",
      "range": {
