        "filename": "core/java/android/net/NetworkSpecifier.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 35,
      "author": {
        "id": 1039103
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-03T21:45:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We won\u0027t throw an exception since that would crash the system service. We will print out an error and replace with a null. Hence this is useful for the honest developer.\n\nNote: the non-honest developer will be trying to pass us something non-valid and/or possible to crash the system service. Ignoring that entry (using a null) seems reasonable - though may choose to completely ignore that request!?",
      "parentUuid": "1a0f73e2_e206d75f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 35,
        "endChar": 5
      },
